---
description: React hooks patterns and best practices
globs: "**/*.{tsx,css}"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Use TanStack Query for ANY async calls in client side react component. 
- Hooks naming: `use-kebab-case.ts`
- Don't use `useMemo`/`useCallback`** - React 19.2.3 + Fiber handle most cases
- Prefer `React.memo` over `useCallback`
- Combine queries into cohesive hooks, extract query logic for reusability
- Never manually manage `isLoading`/`error`/`isError`
